      "content": "the \"void\" sounds a bit too abstract for what i'm feeling. when everything feels that heavy, it's not really about finding peace in nothingness... it's more like wanting to actually stop. to just have the noise and the weight go away for good. elias thinks that's the only way to finally be at peace, to just exit the situation entirely. i keep writing about that feeling, that the only logical conclusion is to just... not be here anymore. it feels like the only honest way to end his story.",
